        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I just wanted to take a moment to express my deepest gratitude to the incredible kidzworld fashion. From the moment I discovered this adorable and stylish range of clothing, I knew that I had found a treasure trove of precious little things for my baby.\nThe quality of their products is truly exceptional - soft, comfortable, and designed with love and care. Every item I've purchased has been a delight to receive, with its beautiful packaging and attention to detail. But it's not just the products themselves that I'm grateful for - it's the wonderful customer service and the way it goes above and beyond to ensure that every customer feels valued and supported.",
        "time": 1737081924,
